title: "Quantum Foundry"
abstract: >-
  Open-source implementations of quantum algorithms, documented and tested
  with production engineering rigor. Each algorithm is developed through an
  RFC, and carries mathematical foundations, circuit derivation, software
  implementation, tests, and benchmarks.
